  <p id="c-chenshu-018-chen18:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-018-chen18:p001:m0000" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAD">王質</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-018-chen18:p001:m0003" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAD">子貞</persName>，右光祿大夫<persName id="c-chenshu-018-chen18:p001:m0011" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAC">通</persName>之弟也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-018-chen18:p002" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">高宗為揚州刺史，以<persName id="c-chenshu-018-chen18:p002:m0009" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAD">質</persName>為仁威將軍、驃騎府長史。天嘉二年，除晉安太守。高宗輔政，以為司徒左長史，將軍如故。坐公事免官。尋為通直散騎常侍，遷太府卿、都官尚書。太建二年卒，時年六十。贈本官，諡曰安子。</p>
</text>
